 125:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \brief   Enable IRQ Interrupts
 126:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Enables IRQ interrupts by clearing the I-bit in the CPSR.
